  "title": "Street Fighter Zero The Animation",
  "justification": "The two volumes of \"Street Fighter Zero The Animation\" (1999-12-22) are TVDB season 0 episode 3 \"Street Fighter Alpha: The Animation\" (2000-06-24) and TMDB 31713 season 0 episode 2 \"Street Fighter Alpha: The Animation\" (1999-12-22); the row sent them to TVDB episode 2, the Fujiwara Capital film. The specials S1-S11 (cast and staff interviews) and S12 \"The Making Of\" have no TVDB or TMDB episode; by default they fell on the other films, OVAs, openings and endings at TVDB episodes 1-12 and on TMDB episodes 1-4, so they are unmapped.",
